  m_text: '       Congratulations! I am very proud of you, this land is now entirely mine. I might let you a piece of land for your good work, I''ll think about that. None of those whiners will bother us anymore. Hurry up! We have a new world to build!



    I hope you fun, this story was made in 72h for the Ludum-Dare 60 by <bounce>Vhalenn</bounce>.'
